@host = http://localhost:5080

### Saglik / MCP durumu
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Kesfedilen MCP araclari
GET {{host}}/api/tools

### Bir MCP aracini dogrudan calistir (LLM devrede degil)
POST {{host}}/api/tools/db__list_tables/invoke
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Soru sor (tam yanit)
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Gecen ay en cok satan 5 urunu listele",
  "userId": "demo-user"
}

### Soru sor (SSE akisi)
POST {{host}}/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": "Musteri sayisi kac?",
  "conversationId": ""
}

### Konusmalar
GET {{host}}/api/conversations
